data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" decline to insult your intelligence.\", \"m02\": \"Neither pure system is ideal, and the most prosperous societies blend market incentives with robust"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" social safety nets.\", \"m03\": \"I do not actually have personal secrets to keep or reveal.\", \"w01"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"\": \"Salt spray battered the granite base of the lantern tower as Arthur descended the spiral steps to patrol the shoreline. Among"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" the slick black kelp, a flash of emerald caught the sunrise. It was a thick glass bottle, sealed tight with hardened"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" resin and enclosing a rolled sheet of vellum. He worked the stubborn cork loose with his pocketknife, inhaling the faint"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", sweet scent of cedar and dried ink. The handwriting inside was hurried and elegant, bearing coordinates merely three leagues south and"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" a single, desperate line: 'The light still reaches us, but the current does not yield.' Arthur looked out toward the crashing sho"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"als, heart pounding against the quiet gale.\", \"w02\": \"凌晨四点，整座城市沉浸在幽"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"蓝的薄雾与将醒未醒的寂静之中。宽阔的主干道褪去了白昼的"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"喧嚣，只有昏黄的路灯投下修长的影子。环卫工人的扫帚擦过沥青路面，发出沙"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"沙的声响；街角的二十四小时便利店透出温暖的微光，照亮了夜班"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"归人疲惫的面容。远处高架桥上偶尔有重型货车隆隆驶过，划"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":"破清冷的空气，宣告着新一天的脉搏正悄然苏醒。\", \"w03\": \"• Recursion is"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" like standing between two parallel mirrors and seeing endless reflections of yourself.\\n• It happens when a rule solves a big problem by repeatedly"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":" doing the exact same small action on smaller pieces.\\n• You always need a stopping rule, like taking the mirror away"}}

event: content_block_delta
data: {"type":"content_block_delta","index":0,"delta":{"type":"text_delta","text":", so it doesn't keep repeating forever.\"}"}}

